libvslvm (libYAL Linux LVM library)

Library to access the Linux Logical Volume Manager (LVM) volume system
format.

Not supported:

* multiple physical volumes
* multiple segments
* non-linear stripes
* snapshots

Note that to use libvslvm with the Sleuthkit, a stand-alone version of 
libbfio (available on SlackBuilds.org) is needed to allow libvslvm to 
directly read from a TSK_IMAGE.
